  "description": "It was their first reunion in five years. “Ricky”, the man who had imprisoned “Barry,” raped him, and even killed his own gang members out of jealousy had tracked him down after five years. Ricky claimed he had made a mistake in the past and promised things would be different this time. A routine ensued in which Ricky would find Barry, force himself on him, and then let hi go. Then, amid his confusion, Barry found himself presented with an opportunity to kill Ricky.\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
